<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Spaceman Strategist AI</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Spaceman Strategist AI</h1>
        <p>Pelajari pola dan uji strategi Anda dalam simulasi game Spaceman.</p>

        <div class="game-area">
            <div id="multiplier" class="multiplier">1.00x</div>
            <div id="rocket" class="rocket">🚀</div>
            <div id="status-message" class="status-message">Siap untuk simulasi!</div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls">
            <button id="startButton">Mulai Simulasi</button>
            <input type="number" id="takeProfitInput" placeholder="Target Take Profit (ex: 2.00)" step="0.01" min="1.01">
            <button id="manualTakeProfitButton" class="hidden">Take Profit Sekarang</button>
        </div>

        <div class="statistics">
            <h2>Statistik Sesi</h2>
            <p>Total Putaran: <span id="totalRounds">0</span></p>
            <p>Kemenangan: <span id="wins">0</span></p>
            <p>Kekalahan: <span id="losses">0</span></p>
            <p>Rata-rata Crash: <span id="avgCrash">N/A</span></p>
            <canvas id="crashChart"></canvas>
        </div>

        <div class="info">
            <h3>Cara Kerja:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Klik "Mulai Simulasi" untuk memulai putaran.</li>
                <li>Roket akan terbang dan pengali akan meningkat.</li>
                <li>Tentukan target "Take Profit" Anda atau klik "Take Profit Sekarang" secara manual sebelum roket meledak.</li>
                <li>AI akan menganalisis data crash dari simulasi Anda.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Aplikasi ini adalah alat edukasi dan hiburan. Tidak ada jaminan kemenangan dalam game asli.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    background-color: #1a1a2e;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

.container {
    background-color: #2a0a5e;
    border-radius: 15px;
    padding: 30px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 700px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #4a2a8e;
}

h1 {
    color: #9d50f8;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

p {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.game-area {
    background-color: #1a0a3e;
    border: 2px solid #6a3a9e;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 30px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    min-height: 150px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.multiplier {
    font-size: 4em;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #4CAF50; /* Green for active multiplier */
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    transition: all 0.1s ease-out;
}

.multiplier.crashed {
    color: #f44336; /* Red when crashed */
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(244, 67, 54, 0.7);
}

.rocket {
    font-size: 3em;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    transition: bottom 0.5s ease-out; /* For rocket animation */
}

.status-message {
    font-size: 1.1em;
    color: #bbb;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

.controls {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

button {
    background-color: #9d50f8;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px 25px;
    font-size: 1.1em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

button:hover {
    background-color: #8a3fe0;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
}

button:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
}

button:disabled {
    background-color: #555;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    box-shadow: none;
}

input[type="number"] {
    background-color: #3a1a6e;
    border: 1px solid #6a3a9e;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    font-size: 1em;
    width: 180px;
    text-align: center;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
}

input[type="number"]:focus {
    border-color: #9d50f8;
}

.statistics {
    background-color: #1a0a3e;
    border: 1px solid #4a2a8e;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    text-align: left;
}

.statistics h2 {
    color: #9d50f8;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    text-align: center;
}

.statistics p {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 1.05em;
}

canvas {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: 200px; /* Fixed height for chart */
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 15px;
}

.info {
    background-color: #1a0a3e;
    border: 1px solid #4a2a8e;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.9em;
}

.info h3 {
    color: #9d50f8;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-align: center;
}

.info ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.info li {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.hidden {
    display: none !important;
}
